@layout "includes/layout.smol"

@title Pax Domus Finance Terms of Use
@description Terms for the private Pax Domus Finance household-finance application.
@viewport width=device-width, initial-scale=1
@lang en
@charset utf-8
@meta(name="robots" content="noindex")
@set canonical_url https://chriskjaer.com/finance/terms/

:head
  style
    body
      overflow: auto
    .page
      justify-content: flex-start
      padding: 4rem 1rem 6rem
    .legal
      width: 100%
      max-width: 42rem
      font-size: 1rem
      line-height: 1.7
    .legal h1
      font-size: 2rem
      line-height: 1.15
      margin: 0 0 .5rem
    .legal h2
      font-size: 1.1rem
      margin: 2rem 0 .5rem
    .legal p
      margin: 0 0 1rem
    .meta
      color: #6b7280
      font-size: .9rem

:body
  main.page
    article.legal
      h1 | Pax Domus Finance Terms of Use
      p.meta | Last updated: 28 July 2026
      p
        | Pax Domus Finance is a private application for the operator and his household. It is not offered as a public or commercial service.
      h2 | Scope
      p
        | The application provides read-only aggregation, budgeting and reporting. It does not initiate payments or trades and does not provide financial, investment, tax or legal advice.
      p
        | Users remain responsible for checking information against their banks, brokers and official records.
      h2 | Access and availability
      p
        | Access is limited to authorised household members through a private network. The operator may change, suspend or discontinue the application at any time.
      h2 | Contact
      p
        | Questions can be sent to
        a(href="mailto:me@chriskjaer.com") me@chriskjaer.com.
